### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Favour",
  "email": "test4@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test4@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

